OL,3,GNEWSAHGVs causing 'pandemonium' in
OL,4,Ahistoric town
OL,5,
OL,6,FLorries are causing "pandemonium" in a
OL,7,Fhistoric town after hitting the same
OL,8,Fbuildings multiple times and knocking
OL,9,Fdown fences, campaigners claim.
OL,11,FResidents and business owners in
OL,12,FMalmesbury are calling on the council
OL,13,Fto take urgent action, with resident
OL,14,FJeffrey Manton saying a HGV hit his
OL,15,FGrade II listed building as it
OL,16,Fattempted to squeeze through
OL,17,Fcenturies-old streets.
OL,19,F"These vehicles are vast, enormous.
OL,20,FWhen HGVs come through, it's
OL,21,Fpandemonium. We're asking for more than
OL,22,Fjust talk," he said.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
