OL,3,GNEWSAHGVs causing 'pandemonium' in
OL,4,Ahistoric town
OL,5,
OL,6,FWiltshire Council said it recognises
OL,7,Fthe worries and that there is a 7.5
OL,8,Ftonne restriction, which the authority
OL,9,Fhas been reviewing.
